1
00:00:00,414 --> 00:00:02,744
(Penny:)for any surprises
that might happen tomorrow.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,880
(Amy:)What surprises?

3
00:00:04,885 --> 00:00:06,815
(Sheldon:)Oh.

4
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,090
(Bernadette:)We don't want to
spoil anything,

5
00:00:09,089 --> 00:00:14,029
(Bernadette:)but you should know that Sheldon
said he's ready to be physical.

6
00:00:14,028 --> 00:00:16,528
You shut your damn mouth!

7
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:22,897
(Amy:)You actually heard him say this?

8
00:00:22,903 --> 00:00:24,203
(Penny:)Yes. He said he wants
to do something

9
00:00:24,204 --> 00:00:25,634
(Penny:)to show you how much
you mean to him.

10
00:00:25,639 --> 00:00:30,209
(exhales)
I-I can't believe it. I...

11
00:00:31,612 --> 00:00:33,912
(Amy:)I don't know what to say.

12
00:00:33,914 --> 00:00:35,784
(Bernadette:)Well, we're really
happy for you,

13
00:00:35,783 --> 00:00:37,483
(Bernadette:)and we know how
much he cares...

14
00:00:37,484 --> 00:00:39,254
I do know what to say!
Let's get me waxed!

15
00:00:44,858 --> 00:00:47,058
(whirring)

16
00:00:48,695 --> 00:00:52,965
(Arthur:)Why isn't it ever
Angie Dickinson's bedroom?

17
00:00:54,034 --> 00:00:55,704
(Sheldon:)You're back.

18
00:00:55,702 --> 00:00:59,902
It-it doesn't seem
like it's up to me.

